¿A qué?

134
00:10:26,126 --> 00:10:27,126
¿A qué?

135
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,711
Tienes que entender, papá.

136
00:10:33,675 --> 00:10:34,675
Ana"?

137
00:10:35,677 --> 00:10:37,417
